Subject: netfilter: keep Kite ingress matches separate from routed output actions

Handle DIRECT/NEIGH independently, use post-NAT neighbour addresses and the
correct union member. A bridged AP receives Ethernet frames addressed to the
L3 bridge MAC, which need not equal its BSSID. Preserve native Ethernet mangle
actions for PPE egress, and retain all exact ingress policy restrictions.

